msgid "FluentSMTP is configured — check FluentSMTP → Email Logs; the sender address usually has to match the authenticated domain."
msgstr "FluentSMTP 已設定——請看 FluentSMTP → Email Logs；寄件者位址通常必須與驗證的網域一致。"

