msgid "WP Mail SMTP is installed — run its “Email Test” to see the provider error, and make sure the From address uses your domain."
msgstr "已安裝 WP Mail SMTP——請用它內建的「Email Test」看供應商錯誤，並確認寄件者使用你的網域。"

