msgid "(not set)"
msgstr "（未設定）"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "FluentSMTP is set to read the %s OAuth keys from wp-config.php, but the constants are missing — the Client ID therefore reaches the provider empty and the request is rejected. Declare FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_ID and FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET in wp-config.php, or switch that connection to “database” in FluentSMTP and paste the keys there, then reconnect."
msgstr "FluentSMTP 設定成從 wp-config.php 讀取 %s 的 OAuth 金鑰，但常數沒有定義——送到供應商的 Client ID 因此是空的，請求被拒。請在 wp-config.php 宣告 FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_ID 與 FLUENTMAIL_GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET，或在 FluentSMTP 把該連線改成「資料庫」並直接填入金鑰，然後重新連線。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "FluentSMTP has no OAuth Client ID for this %s connection. Paste the Client ID and Secret from Google Cloud Console (OAuth client of type “Web application”) into FluentSMTP, then click “Connect to Google” again."
msgstr "FluentSMTP 的這個 %s 連線沒有 OAuth Client ID。請把 Google Cloud Console 的 Client ID 與 Secret（OAuth 用戶端類型選「網頁應用程式」）貼進 FluentSMTP，再按一次「Connect to Google」。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The %s OAuth keys exist, but the authorisation is no longer valid (the refresh token was revoked or expired). In FluentSMTP remove that connection and add it again, completing the consent screen — this also refreshes the token."
msgstr "%s 的 OAuth 金鑰存在，但授權已失效（refresh token 被撤銷或過期）。請在 FluentSMTP 刪除該連線並重新新增，走完同意畫面——這會同時更新 token。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "FluentSMTP has no sender address on the default connection — set “From Email” there; most providers reject mail without a verified sender."
msgstr "FluentSMTP 的預設連線沒有寄件者位址——請在該連線設定「From Email」；多數供應商會拒收沒有驗證寄件者的郵件。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "The provider rejected the request because no OAuth Client ID was sent. Check the SMTP plugin's connection settings and reconnect the account."
msgstr "供應商因為沒有送出 OAuth Client ID 而拒絕請求。請檢查 SMTP 外掛的連線設定並重新連接帳號。"


#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Mail transport: an SMTP plugin is active, but its connection settings could not be read."
msgstr "寄信方式：偵測到 SMTP 外掛，但讀不到它的連線設定。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "Mail transport: PHP mail() — no SMTP plugin is active, so most hosts will refuse to deliver."
msgstr "寄信方式：PHP mail()——沒有啟用 SMTP 外掛，多數主機不會投遞。"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
msgid "OAuth keys from wp-config.php"
msgstr "OAuth 金鑰來自 wp-config.php"

#: (added by tools/i18n-build.py)
